  "label": "Black Man with Vitiligo as Subject of Stereotype",
  "description": "The image of a Black man with vitiligo can be interpreted through the lens of racial stereotypes. While vitiligo is a medical condition, in some contexts, it has been used to reinforce negative racial tropes, such as implying that Black people are 'less than' or 'not whole'. The meme’s humor or message may rely on the audience recognizing this potential stereotype, even if it is not explicitly stated.",
